From: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>
Subject: [PATCH] firmware: qcom: scm: use the current wait queue interface

The wait queue helper takes the context directly and obtains the SCM
instance internally. Match its declaration when the SMC path is enabled.

Signed-off-by: lean <chenlin@fnnas.com>

--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm-smc.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm-smc.c
@@ -111,7 +111,7 @@
 			smc_call_ctx = res->a2;
 
 			trace_scm_waitq_sleep(wq_ctx, smc_call_ctx);
-			ret = qcom_scm_wait_for_wq_completion(dev, wq_ctx);
+			ret = qcom_scm_wait_for_wq_completion(wq_ctx);
 			if (ret)
 				return ret;
 
